  "2026-08-10T00:51:51.782Z","harness:codex","Governance remediation: after normal reopen and claim, pm-changelog 2026.8.7 regenerated/check-verified the real tracker unchanged with changelog-exclude active. The earlier unclaimed tag append remains immutable history; this claimed verification records the corrected lifecycle without rewriting it."
